            datasheet: "BCD to 7-segment driver\n\nTurns a BCD digit D3..D0 into the segments a..g of a common display (1 = segment lit):\n\n```\n  aaa\n f   b\n  ggg\n e   c\n  ddd\n```\n\nInputs 10–15 are not BCD digits; they light other, unspecified patterns.",
